<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AAR coverage initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AAR coverage initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs has initiated coverage of AAR Corp and added the stock to its recommended list, the brokerage firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- No further information was available.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Wood Dale, Ill.-based aviation service firm were trading at 27-3/4, up 3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
